<title>Pakistan and Afghanistan: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/afghanistan-pakistan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-afghanistan-pakistan-2026-11-02T18:37:28.964Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 02 Nov 2026 18:37:28 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Pakistani security forces have again engaged Afghan Taliban posts in South Waziristan, returning fire after the Taliban opened fire on border posts. In Karachi, a PIA engineer was gunned down in a suspected targeted attack, and in Balochistan multiple attacks have hit Pakistani forces. A Learjet crashed in Florida, unrelated to the regional conflict, while a traffic crash in eastern Afghanistan killed two and injured three. The conflict has caused 1,794 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTE9YMXI0RnFxaWhLYjgxc05pOW94aldUYm5PODRKSnRpV20weFFJZ0s1OGo4Y19sSG55UENSTjE2U0Z4cjJxX0FZeA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTE9qVjFna053OEp2bnVMQlVlTjJkOVZiRHZ5NUZQWGRmZGNiNm9pdnlqcVFOSjkwMkxNM3Zkb09tY2UyUmNIMHNYcQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Social News XYZ&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxOQkh3X3ZzODd2UklXTTd4c05sdzNYRVFmRG95Nk1FWHZYX2RtNGJScXFYUzZCTEF4TFNvbTJtWUhqbGFVd2x5SmZ1UXJCczhVQ010UFNkVzZmZVlETG9ranA3NnB2djV6aFJsME1Cc1J1MFlZbWt6U1FyNlIxWk5MUGVhNHZxdzVZLVRTNUdnSnlQSWR3RklEWWw0R3dHVk5WSWtjb3dya3o?oc=5&quot;&gt;Pakistan Today&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivwFBVV95cUxNMzVRSWdsZThsUXQyV0lMQmNtWDZXTU5GTFJFb1JDa1dVRTJ3Q245aVpHX2JNVlJlbUtjYVNmU29faUVObWVPenRBN2M2TmRJZ2EzUm52b3BBZXZhWGdNZGt2TzduZ08wOTFndTd6N0ktV2hZZ0RXNkxXSkloMnNnM3N1UFhtdm5hMlEyZDdKcEhOLWZMTnRVTmduRWhUWHRNLXBZZG83SkE4WmtFVmw3cWQzRkgtTDNIT3pQdWstTQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Mashriq TV&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizAFBVV95cUxOZzNVcVJtN2NDMjJOS0RJRmZHNFFQVHlMajFveXlpRy1panM2d2U4TFlHakJ0bkJRZFRfRHoyX21rNEFKeXJ0dFM2eThPLUV6SWV4ZUs1S0xaZHZHbzR4dTd4TWZSVGN